1. `cp watchtower.example watchtower.env`
2. Pick a shoutrrr notification service and fill in `WATCHTOWER_NOTIFICATION_URL`
   in `watchtower.env` (ntfy is the fastest to set up: install the ntfy app,
   subscribe to a topic, use `ntfy://<topic>@ntfy.sh`).
3. `docker compose -f docker-compose.yml up -d --pull always`
4. Check `docker logs watchtower` after the first scheduled run (default
   08:00 daily) to confirm notifications are firing.

No further action needed — this stack reports only, it never touches other
containers.
